`cargo test` ran phase-078's `ensure_full_history()` (`git fetch --unshallow`), which completed the clone. Phase-078's finding reproduces; the supersession was not performed. The DoD's "assert the eight are **NOT** ancestors of HEAD" would have been a test that passes only while the clone is shallow, so the inverse assertion was written instead — with `ensure_full_history()` first — and REPORT.md says why.

